      "id": 1357022,
      "name": "[Tsukishiro Yanagi] Soaring Moonlight",
      "desc": "During <color=#FFAF2C>EX Special Attack: Gekka Ruten</color>, after performing a quick thrust, Tsukishiro Yanagi hovers in midair, <color=#31CC00>continuously channeling thunderbolt strikes down</color>, and dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>. When her thunderbolt strikes hit enemies, <color=#31CC00>the Disorder DMG they take increases by 60%</color> for 6s. When <color=#FFAF2C>EX Special Attack: Gekka Ruten</color>'s heavy attack hits enemies, it grants Yanagi a <color=#FFAF2C>Shield</color> equal to 20% of her Max HP for 20s.",
